            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Outpatient or &quot;ambulatory&quot; anesthesia and surgery has revolutionized the way surgery is practiced in the United States. Safe, reliable, inexpensive, and convenient outpatient surgery is an attractive option for parents, children, health care providers, and insurers.</AbstractText>
